            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> is this issue about follow-mode (`q=`) only?\n\nHmm, that's a good question. I think at minimum it should collapse in follow mode, as conceptually all of the cursors \"move to the same location\". As for when not in follow-mode, its hard to say, since that mode is a Nvim-only concept. I think it could definitely make since to keep the current behavior as is while out of follow mode.\n\n",
