            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> I think at minimum it should collapse in follow mode, as conceptually all of the cursors \"move to the same location\".\n\neven in follow-mode, jumps/scrolls/mouse intentionally never follow (\"cascade\").\n\nmodeless editors act the way they do because they don't have modes, or at least they don't have users that are accustomed to dealing with modes. but in any case, we should do what is most intuitive and useful.",
